Seemless WP7.5: device requirements MoltenVK cannot meet (S8 H1, H2).

H1: VK_EXT_transform_feedback is no longer required. Metal has no stream
    output. Pipelines with SO already fail with E_NOTIMPL; SO_STATISTICS
    query heaps now do too.
H2: single-texel buffer-view alignment is no longer required when typed
    views go through the typed offset buffer (no descriptor buffer/heap).
    vkd3d_create_buffer_view_for_resource moves the view start down to the
    driver's alignment (MoltenVK: 16 bytes) and adds the remainder to the
    offset the shader applies to every index. Internal views created
    directly with vkd3d_create_buffer_view (UAV clears, copies) are not
    covered yet.
